    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 15.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þeof, siððan he bið on cyninges bende, nah he þa swicne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A thief, once he is in the king’s confinement, does not have the right to clear himself by an oath.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">A thief shall not have the right of clearing himself by oath after he is in the king's power.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðeof, syððan he bið on cyninges bende, nah he ða swicne.</ab>
      </div>
